  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> For each of the six harrow suits, choose one magic talent or combat talent that you meet the prerequisites for. You may change these talents every time you gain a level. At the start of each of your turns during combat, you may draw a card from the harrow deck, gaining the talent corresponding to the suit of the drawn card for one round. At the start of the next turn, shuffle that card back into the deck (you may draw a new card as normal).</p>\n<p>You may choose to draw a card for this feat outside of combat, but may only do so one per hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess both Harrowed Capability and Harrowed Talents, you draw a single card to determine the effects of both feats.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Expanded Spheres: Cardcaster’s Gamble</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
